{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/e2bb858fc4307138dd5997a0839940c5.poster.avif?t=1760704008\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/e2bb858fc4307138dd5997a0839940c5.webm?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/e2bb858fc4307138dd5997a0839940c5.mp4?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <i>Neon Drive</i> comes the sequel you've been waiting for: <strong>Neon Hyperdrive</strong> is faster, flashier, and louder in every way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/0786b1d836ac621590388c94700148b6.poster.avif?t=1760704008\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/0786b1d836ac621590388c94700148b6.webm?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/0786b1d836ac621590388c94700148b6.mp4?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This is rhythm racing reimagined: drift tight corners, surf through glowing waves, and fly across neon skies in sync with the music. Each level is a playable music video, with cinematic angles, reactive visuals, and catchy music tracks that drive the action. Master multiple vehicles \u2014 car, speedboat, and a plane \u2014 and discover new ways to dodge obstacles, each tied to rhythm or melody. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/81c32cfb3b131d5819b952ad68213ee8.poster.avif?t=1760704008\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/81c32cfb3b131d5819b952ad68213ee8.webm?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/81c32cfb3b131d5819b952ad68213ee8.mp4?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/7169d884650bba48542d89d325c1aa83.poster.avif?t=1760704008\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/7169d884650bba48542d89d325c1aa83.webm?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/7169d884650bba48542d89d325c1aa83.mp4?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/bb6cb10dc3fc360a6877fc3b37d6dea9.poster.avif?t=1760704008\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/bb6cb10dc3fc360a6877fc3b37d6dea9.webm?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/bb6cb10dc3fc360a6877fc3b37d6dea9.mp4?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/9f3c2f50617dae9ded9ecdbfad3e91ec.avif?t=1760704008\" width=608 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore surreal worlds across a vast hypergrid, where every scene is packed with detail and every beat shapes what you see and do. With longer levels, more intense challenges, and a soundscape that hits harder than ever, Neon Hyperdrive turns every run into a high-speed, music-fueled trip. If Neon Drive lit the spark, Neon Hyperdrive will launch you into overdri\u2026 er\u2026 hyperdrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if all this sounds like too much of a challenge for you, don't worry \u2014 there's an <strong>Easy Mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/31cc402f6e56fb7de57d793512294777.poster.avif?t=1760704008\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/31cc402f6e56fb7de57d793512294777.webm?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/31cc402f6e56fb7de57d793512294777.mp4?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3422100?t=1760704008","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/caa5be5dbcdf88b7574224687c6616fcad7f2136/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760704008","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/742035d0d6e46b1f36d4c5175e5b03ce65139782/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760704008","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/742035d0d6e46b1f36d4c5175e5b03ce65139782/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760704008","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/e2bb858fc4307138dd5997a0839940c5.poster.avif?t=1760704008\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/e2bb858fc4307138dd5997a0839940c5.webm?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/e2bb858fc4307138dd5997a0839940c5.mp4?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <i>Neon Drive</i> comes the sequel you've been waiting for: <strong>Neon Hyperdrive</strong> is faster, flashier, and louder in every way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/0786b1d836ac621590388c94700148b6.poster.avif?t=1760704008\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/0786b1d836ac621590388c94700148b6.webm?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/0786b1d836ac621590388c94700148b6.mp4?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This is rhythm racing reimagined: drift tight corners, surf through glowing waves, and fly across neon skies in sync with the music. Each level is a playable music video, with cinematic angles, reactive visuals, and catchy music tracks that drive the action. Master multiple vehicles \u2014 car, speedboat, and a plane \u2014 and discover new ways to dodge obstacles, each tied to rhythm or melody. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/81c32cfb3b131d5819b952ad68213ee8.poster.avif?t=1760704008\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/81c32cfb3b131d5819b952ad68213ee8.webm?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/81c32cfb3b131d5819b952ad68213ee8.mp4?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/7169d884650bba48542d89d325c1aa83.poster.avif?t=1760704008\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/7169d884650bba48542d89d325c1aa83.webm?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/7169d884650bba48542d89d325c1aa83.mp4?t=1760704008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea